        <div class="content">
          <section class="section active" id="overview">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="eyebrow">00 // Visão geral</div>
              <h2 class="section-title">O que foi corrigido</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">A proposta visual foi mantida, mas a implementação foi simplificada e fortalecida. Agora o site usa componentes mais acessíveis, contadores dinâmicos, menu mobile e revisão técnica persistente.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="notice tip">
              <div>💡</div>
              <p>Esta versão usa <strong>data attributes</strong> para navegação, botões reais em vez de links clicáveis sem href, <strong>localStorage</strong> para o checklist de revisão e manual com os principais JCLs e COBOLs comentados.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="cards">
              <article class="card">
                <div>🧭</div>
                <h3>Navegação reescrita</h3>
                <p>As ações agora são ligadas por JavaScript centralizado, sem onclick inline.</p>
                <span class="chip green">corrigido</span>
              </article>
              <article class="card">
                <div>♿</div>
                <h3>Acessibilidade melhorada</h3>
                <p>Accordions com aria-expanded, foco visível e skip link.</p>
                <span class="chip green">corrigido</span>
              </article>
              <article class="card">
                <div>📱</div>
                <h3>Sidebar mobile</h3>
                <p>Agora o menu lateral abre e fecha em telas menores com overlay.</p>
                <span class="chip green">corrigido</span>
              </article>
              <article class="card">
                <div>💾</div>
                <h3>Checklist persistente</h3>
                <p>Itens de revisão marcados como resolvidos continuam salvos ao recarregar.</p>
                <span class="chip green">corrigido</span>
              </article>
              <article class="card">
                <div>🧱</div>
                <h3>Fluxo batch alinhado</h3>
                <p>DDNAMEs e datasets agora refletem o fluxo real do lab.</p>
                <span class="chip green">corrigido</span>
              </article>
              <article class="card">
                <div>📘</div>
                <h3>Manual ampliado</h3>
                <p>O manual agora inclui os principais programas e jobs comentados.</p>
                <span class="chip blue">novo</span>
              </article>
            </div>

            <div class="diagram">
<pre>FLUXO CORRETO DO LAB

ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ
   │
   ▼
EBJLOAD  → precheck da entrada do dia
   │
   ▼
EBJVALD  → VALIDOS em ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS / REJEITOS em ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ
   │
   ▼
EBJPOST  → MOVTIN = ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS
   │
   ▼
EBJSALD  → SALDIN / SALDOUT
   │
   ▼
EBJEXTR  → GDG de extrato
   │
   ▼
EBJCONC  → CONCOUT
   │
   ▼
EBJEOD   → backup + registro de fechamento</pre>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" id="arch">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="eyebrow">01 // Arquitetura</div>
              <h2 class="section-title">Arquitetura real do laboratório</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">Para reduzir ambiguidade, esta versão deixa claro que o lab oficial roda em IBM Z Xplore. Hercules/TK4- pode existir como trilha alternativa de estudo, mas não como base principal da documentação.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr><th>Camada</th><th>Ferramenta</th><th>Papel</th><th>Status</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><strong>Local</strong></td><td class="mono">VS Code + Git + PowerShell</td><td>Edição, versionamento e scripts</td><td>Oficial</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Integração</strong></td><td class="mono">Zowe CLI / Explorer</td><td>Upload, submit de jobs e consulta de datasets</td><td>Oficial</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Execução</strong></td><td class="mono">IBM Z Xplore / Marist</td><td>z/OS real com PDS, JES2, VSAM e GDG</td><td>Oficial</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Operação</strong></td><td class="mono">Vista TN3270</td><td>TSO, ISPF, SDSF e troubleshooting</td><td>Oficial</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><strong>Alternativa</strong></td><td class="mono">Hercules + TK4-</td><td>Trilha opcional de estudo local</td><td>Opcional</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>

            <div class="diagram">
<pre>PC LOCAL
  │ VS Code + Git + PowerShell
  ▼
ZOWE CLI / ZOWE EXPLORER
  ▼
IBM Z XPLORE / MARIST
  │ Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.*
  ▼
VISTA TN3270
  │ TSO / ISPF / SDSF
  ▼
DIAGNÓSTICO E OPERAÇÃO</pre>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" id="datasets">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="eyebrow">D2 // Mapa de datasets</div>
              <h2 class="section-title">Mapa corrigido de datasets</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">Foram corrigidos o typo de LANCTO.ESDS, a ambiguidade entre EBJLOAD e EBSEED e os datasets faltantes de conciliação, backup e HML.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="notice danger">
              <div>🔴</div>
              <p>O nome correto do arquivo de lançamentos validados é <code>Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS</code>. Esta versão também adiciona <code>ARQ.CONCIL.SEQ</code>, <code>BAK.CONTA.SEQ</code> e <code>HML.LOADLIB</code>.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr><th>Dataset</th><th>Tipo</th><th>DDNAME</th><th>Finalidade</th><th>Usado por</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COBOL</td><td>PDSE</td><td class="mono">SYSIN</td><td>Fontes COBOL</td><td>build</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COPY</td><td>PDSE</td><td class="mono">SYSLIB</td><td>Copybooks</td><td>build</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB</td><td>PDSE</td><td class="mono">STEPLIB</td><td>Executáveis DEV</td><td>jobs batch</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.HML.LOADLIB</td><td>PDSE</td><td class="mono">STEPLIB</td><td>Executáveis HML</td><td>homologação</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CLIENTES.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">CLIENTIN</td><td>Massa inicial de clientes</td><td>EBCLLOAD</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CONTAS.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">CONTAIN</td><td>Massa inicial de contas</td><td>EBCLLOAD</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">ENTRADA</td><td>Lote bruto do dia</td><td>EBJLOAD / EBVALI01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">REJEITOS</td><td>Rejeitos da validação</td><td>EBVALI01 / EBREPR01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.AUDIT.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">AUDIT</td><td>Auditoria operacional</td><td>todos os jobs</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CLIENTE.KSDS</td><td>KSDS</td><td class="mono">CLIENTE</td><td>Cadastro master de clientes</td><td>EBCLLOAD / EBPOST01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONTA.KSDS</td><td>KSDS</td><td class="mono">CONTA</td><td>Cadastro master de contas</td><td>EBPOST01 / EBSALD01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS</td><td>ESDS</td><td class="mono">VALIDOS / MOVTIN</td><td>Lançamentos validados</td><td>EBPOST01 / EBEXTR01 / EBCONC01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.SALDO.KSDS</td><td>KSDS</td><td class="mono">SALDIN</td><td>Saldo consolidado</td><td>EBSALD01 / EBEXTR01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.SALDO.REL.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">SALDOUT</td><td>Saída de saldo</td><td>EBSALD01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.EXTRATO.GDG</td><td>GDG</td><td class="mono">EXTROUT</td><td>Extratos gerados</td><td>EBEXTR01</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONCIL.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">CONCOUT</td><td>Saída da conciliação</td><td>EBCONC01 / EBJEOD</td></tr>
                  <tr><td class="mono">Z77948.EMUNAH.BAK.CONTA.SEQ</td><td>PS</td><td class="mono">OUTBAK</td><td>Backup lógico</td><td>EBJEOD</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" id="batch">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="eyebrow">D3 // Grade batch</div>
              <h2 class="section-title">Cadeia batch corrigida</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">A carga inicial foi separada do processamento do dia. O job antigo de carga foi renomeado conceitualmente para <strong>EBSEED</strong> para não colidir com o papel do EBJLOAD.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="diagram">
<pre>SETUP / SOB DEMANDA
  EBSEED  -> carrega clientes e contas a partir dos arquivos SEED

ROTINA DIÁRIA
  EBJLOAD -> precheck do ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ
  EBJVALD -> valida lote bruto
  EBJPOST -> aplica lançamentos validados
  EBJSALD -> consolida saldo
  EBJEXTR -> gera extrato GDG
  EBJCONC -> concilia totais
  EBJEOD  -> backup + fechamento</pre>
            </div>

            <div class="cards">
              <article class="card">
                <div>✅</div>
                <h3>EBSEED</h3>
                <p>Nome reservado para o job de carga inicial dos seeds.</p>
                <span class="chip green">ajustado</span>
              </article>
              <article class="card">
                <div>🔎</div>
                <h3>EBJLOAD</h3>
                <p>Agora representa somente o precheck da entrada do dia.</p>
                <span class="chip green">corrigido</span>
              </article>
              <article class="card">
                <div>🔁</div>
                <h3>EBJPOST</h3>
                <p>Consome MOVTIN = ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS, nunca mais a entrada bruta.</p>
                <span class="chip green">corrigido</span>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" id="manual">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="eyebrow">M1 // Manual operacional</div>
              <h2 class="section-title">Manual resumido de operação</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">As etapas abaixo cobrem o que você precisa para subir fontes, compilar e rodar a cadeia.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-list">
              <article class="accordion open">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="true">
                  <span class="acc-index">1.1</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">Pré-requisitos locais</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Java, Node, Git, Python, Zowe e Vista TN3270</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">PowerShell</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>Set-ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned

java -version
node --version
git --version
python --version
zowe --version</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index">1.2</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">Perfil Zowe para IBM Z Xplore</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Base oficial do laboratório</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">PowerShell</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>npm install -g @zowe/cli

zowe profiles create zosmf ZXplore ^
  --host wtsc57.itsc.marist.edu ^
  --port 10443 ^
  --user Z77948 ^
  --password SUA_SENHA ^
  --reject-unauthorized false

zowe zosmf check status</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index">1.3</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">Criação básica de datasets</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Sequenciais, VSAM e GDG</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">PowerShell</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>zowe zos-files create data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CLIENTES.SEQ" --like "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ"
zowe zos-files create data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CONTAS.SEQ"   --like "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ"
zowe zos-files create data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ"   --like "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ"
zowe zos-files create data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.AUDIT.SEQ"     --like "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ"
zowe zos-files create data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONCIL.SEQ"    --like "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ"
zowe zos-files create data-set-vsam "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CLIENTE.KSDS"
zowe zos-files create data-set-vsam "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONTA.KSDS"
zowe zos-files create data-set-vsam "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.SALDO.KSDS"</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — CRLANCT</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//CRLANCT  JOB CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,NOTIFY=&SYSUID
//* CRIA O ESDS DE LANCAMENTOS VALIDOS DO LAB
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
  DEFINE CLUSTER ( -
    NAME(Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS) -
    NONINDEXED -
    RECORDSIZE(120 120) -
    RECORDS(10000 2000)) -
  DATA(NAME(Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS.DATA))
/*</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — DEFGDG</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//DEFGDG   JOB CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,NOTIFY=&SYSUID
//* DEFINE A BASE GDG DE EXTRATOS
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
  DEFINE GENERATIONDATAGROUP -
    (NAME(Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.EXTRATO.GDG) -
     LIMIT(30) -
     NOEMPTY -
     SCRATCH)
/*</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index">1.4</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">Upload dos fontes e execução</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Local → host → build → batch</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">PowerShell</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>zowe zos-files upload dir-to-pds .\copybooks\layouts "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COPY"
zowe zos-files upload dir-to-pds .\cobolatch       "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COBOL"
zowe zos-files upload dir-to-pds .\jcl\compile       "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL"
zowe zos-files upload dir-to-pds .\jclatch         "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL"

zowe zos-files upload file-to-data-set .\data\seed\clientes.txt "Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CLIENTES.SEQ"
zowe zos-files upload file-to-data-set .\data\seed\contas.txt   "Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CONTAS.SEQ"
zowe zos-files upload file-to-data-set .\data\entrada\lancamentos_d0.txt "Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ"

zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBSEED)"
zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBJLOAD)"
zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBJVALD)"
zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBJPOST)"
zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBJSALD)"
zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBJEXTR)"
zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBJCONC)"
zowe zos-jobs submit data-set "Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.JCL(EBJEOD)"</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" id="sources">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="eyebrow">M2 // Fontes COBOL e JCL</div>
              <h2 class="section-title">Principais fontes comentados</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">Os exemplos abaixo foram organizados com foco didático. Eles documentam o contrato entre programas, datasets e DDNAMEs do lab.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="notice tip">
              <div>📘</div>
              <p>Os códigos abaixo já refletem as correções mais importantes da revisão: build separado, EBSEED distinto de EBJLOAD, VALIDOS/REJEITOS corretos, MOVTIN coerente e CONCOUT explícito.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-list">
              <article class="accordion open">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="true">
                  <span class="acc-index blue">C1</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">COBOL — EBCLLOAD</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Carga inicial de clientes e contas</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL — EBCLLOAD.cbl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EBCLLOAD.
      *==============================================================*
      * CARGA INICIAL DOS ARQUIVOS DE SEED PARA OS KSDS.             *
      * USAR NA FASE DE SETUP.                                       *
      *==============================================================*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CLIENTE-IN ASSIGN TO CLIENTIN.
           SELECT CONTA-IN   ASSIGN TO CONTAIN.
           SELECT CLIENTE-KSDS ASSIGN TO CLIENTE
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS CLI-ID.
           SELECT CONTA-KSDS ASSIGN TO CONTA
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS CNT-CHAVE.
           SELECT AUDIT-OUT ASSIGN TO AUDIT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD CLIENTE-IN.
       01 REG-CLIENTE-IN.
          COPY CPCLI001.

       FD CONTA-IN.
       01 REG-CONTA-IN.
          COPY CPCNT001.

       FD CLIENTE-KSDS.
       01 REG-CLIENTE.
          COPY CPCLI001.

       FD CONTA-KSDS.
       01 REG-CONTA.
          COPY CPCNT001.

       FD AUDIT-OUT.
       01 REG-AUDIT PIC X(120).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-FIM-CLI PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01 WS-FIM-CNT PIC X VALUE 'N'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PRINCIPAL.
      * PARA CARGA INICIAL, OPEN OUTPUT E O MAIS SEGURO.
           OPEN INPUT CLIENTE-IN CONTA-IN
                OUTPUT CLIENTE-KSDS CONTA-KSDS AUDIT-OUT

           PERFORM UNTIL WS-FIM-CLI = 'S'
               READ CLIENTE-IN
                   AT END MOVE 'S' TO WS-FIM-CLI
                   NOT AT END
                       MOVE REG-CLIENTE-IN TO REG-CLIENTE
                       WRITE REG-CLIENTE
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM

           PERFORM UNTIL WS-FIM-CNT = 'S'
               READ CONTA-IN
                   AT END MOVE 'S' TO WS-FIM-CNT
                   NOT AT END
                       MOVE REG-CONTA-IN TO REG-CONTA
                       WRITE REG-CONTA
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM

           MOVE 'EBCLLOAD OK' TO REG-AUDIT
           WRITE REG-AUDIT
           CLOSE CLIENTE-IN CONTA-IN CLIENTE-KSDS CONTA-KSDS AUDIT-OUT
           GOBACK.</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index blue">C2</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">COBOL — EBVALI01</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Validação do lote bruto</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL — EBVALI01.cbl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EBVALI01.
      *==============================================================*
      * ENTRADA  : ENTRADA  -> ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ                       *
      * VALIDOS  : VALIDOS  -> ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS                       *
      * REJEITOS : REJEITOS -> ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ                       *
      *==============================================================*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MOVTO-IN  ASSIGN TO ENTRADA.
           SELECT MOVTO-VAL ASSIGN TO VALIDOS.
           SELECT MOVTO-REJ ASSIGN TO REJEITOS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD MOVTO-IN.
       01 REG-MOVTO-IN.
          COPY CPLCT001.

       FD MOVTO-VAL.
       01 REG-MOVTO-VAL.
          COPY CPLCT001.

       FD MOVTO-REJ.
       01 REG-MOVTO-REJ.
          COPY CPLCT001.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-FIM PIC X VALUE 'N'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PRINCIPAL.
           OPEN INPUT MOVTO-IN
                OUTPUT MOVTO-VAL MOVTO-REJ

           PERFORM UNTIL WS-FIM = 'S'
               READ MOVTO-IN
                   AT END MOVE 'S' TO WS-FIM
                   NOT AT END
                       PERFORM 1000-VALIDA
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM

           CLOSE MOVTO-IN MOVTO-VAL MOVTO-REJ
           GOBACK.

       1000-VALIDA.
      * EXEMPLO DIDATICO: ACEITA SOMENTE TIPO C OU D.
           IF LCT-TIPO = 'C' OR LCT-TIPO = 'D'
               MOVE REG-MOVTO-IN TO REG-MOVTO-VAL
               WRITE REG-MOVTO-VAL
           ELSE
               MOVE REG-MOVTO-IN TO REG-MOVTO-REJ
               WRITE REG-MOVTO-REJ
           END-IF.</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index blue">C3</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">COBOL — EBPOST01</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Aplicação dos válidos nas contas</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL — EBPOST01.cbl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EBPOST01.
      *==============================================================*
      * LE OS MOVIMENTOS VALIDOS E APLICA NAS CONTAS.                *
      * MOVTIN E O DDNAME CORRETO DE ENTRADA.                        *
      *==============================================================*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MOVTO-IN   ASSIGN TO MOVTIN.
           SELECT CONTA-KSDS ASSIGN TO CONTA
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS CNT-CHAVE.
           SELECT AUDIT-OUT  ASSIGN TO AUDIT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD MOVTO-IN.
       01 REG-MOVTO-IN.
          COPY CPLCT001.

       FD CONTA-KSDS.
       01 REG-CONTA.
          COPY CPCNT001.

       FD AUDIT-OUT.
       01 REG-AUDIT PIC X(120).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-FIM PIC X VALUE 'N'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PRINCIPAL.
           OPEN INPUT MOVTO-IN
                I-O CONTA-KSDS
                EXTEND AUDIT-OUT

           PERFORM UNTIL WS-FIM = 'S'
               READ MOVTO-IN
                   AT END MOVE 'S' TO WS-FIM
                   NOT AT END
                       PERFORM 1000-POSTA
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM

           CLOSE MOVTO-IN CONTA-KSDS AUDIT-OUT
           GOBACK.

       1000-POSTA.
      * CHAVE DE CONTA MONTADA A PARTIR DO MOVIMENTO.
           MOVE LCT-AGENCIA TO CNT-AGENCIA
           MOVE LCT-CONTA   TO CNT-NUM-CONTA
           READ CONTA-KSDS
               INVALID KEY
                   MOVE 'CONTA NAO ENCONTRADA' TO REG-AUDIT
                   WRITE REG-AUDIT
               NOT INVALID KEY
                   IF LCT-TIPO = 'C'
                       ADD LCT-VALOR TO CNT-SALDO-ATUAL
                   ELSE
                       SUBTRACT LCT-VALOR FROM CNT-SALDO-ATUAL
                   END-IF
                   REWRITE REG-CONTA
           END-READ.</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index blue">C4</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">COBOL — EBSALD01, EBEXTR01 e EBCONC01</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Trechos-base documentados</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL — EBSALD01.cbl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EBSALD01.
      * SALDIN = ARQ.SALDO.KSDS
      * SALDOUT = ARQ.SALDO.REL.SEQ

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SALDO-IN  ASSIGN TO SALDIN.
           SELECT SALDO-OUT ASSIGN TO SALDOUT.</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL — EBEXTR01.cbl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EBEXTR01.
      * MOVTIN = ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS
      * SALDO  = ARQ.SALDO.KSDS
      * EXTROUT = GDG(+1)

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MOVTO-IN    ASSIGN TO MOVTIN.
           SELECT SALDO-IN    ASSIGN TO SALDO.
           SELECT EXTRATO-OUT ASSIGN TO EXTROUT.</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL — EBCONC01.cbl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EBCONC01.
      * MOVTIN = ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS
      * CONCOUT = ARQ.CONCIL.SEQ

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MOVTO-IN    ASSIGN TO MOVTIN.
           SELECT CONCIL-OUT  ASSIGN TO CONCOUT.</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index amber">J1</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">JCL — EBCOMP, EBLINK e EBBUILD</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Build corretamente separado</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBCOMP.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBCOMP   JOB ,'EMUNAH COMP',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* APENAS COMPILACAO DO FONTE COBOL.
//COMPILE  EXEC PGM=IGYCRCTL,PARM='OBJECT,LIST,MAP,APOST,RENT'
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSLIB   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COPY,DISP=SHR
//SYSIN    DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COBOL(&PGMNAME),DISP=SHR
//SYSLIN   DD DSN=&&OBJ,DISP=(,PASS),UNIT=SYSDA,
//            SPACE=(TRK,(1,1)),DCB=(RECFM=FB,LRECL=80,BLKSIZE=3200)</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBLINK.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBLINK   JOB ,'EMUNAH LINK',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* APENAS LINK-EDICAO DO OBJETO GERADO NO EBCOMP.
//LINK     EXEC PGM=IEWBLINK,PARM='RENT,REUS'
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSLIN   DD DSN=&&OBJ,DISP=(OLD,DELETE)
//SYSLMOD  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB(&PGMNAME),DISP=SHR</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBBUILD.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBBUILD  JOB ,'EMUNAH BUILD',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* COMPILE + LINK EM UM UNICO JOB.
//CL       EXEC IGYWCL
//COBOL.SYSIN   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COBOL(EBCLLOAD),DISP=SHR
//COBOL.SYSLIB  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.COPY,DISP=SHR
//LKED.SYSLMOD  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB(EBCLLOAD),DISP=SHR
//LKED.SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index amber">J2</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">JCL — EBSEED, EBJLOAD e EBJVALD</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Setup inicial e rotina do dia</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBSEED.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBSEED   JOB ,'EMUNAH SEED',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* CARGA INICIAL DOS SEEDS PARA CLIENTE.KSDS E CONTA.KSDS.
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=EBCLLOAD
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//CLIENTIN DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CLIENTES.SEQ,DISP=SHR
//CONTAIN  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.SEED.CONTAS.SEQ,DISP=SHR
//CLIENTE  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CLIENTE.KSDS,DISP=OLD
//CONTA    DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONTA.KSDS,DISP=OLD
//AUDIT    DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.AUDIT.SEQ,DISP=MOD</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBJLOAD.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBJLOAD  JOB ,'EMUNAH LOAD',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* PRECHECK DA ENTRADA DO DIA.
//PRECHECK EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD *
  LISTCAT ENT('Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ') ALL
  IF LASTCC > 0 THEN -
    SET MAXCC = 12
/*</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBJVALD.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBJVALD  JOB ,'EMUNAH VALD',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* VALIDA O LOTE BRUTO.
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=EBVALI01
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//ENTRADA  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.ENTRADA.SEQ,DISP=SHR
//VALIDOS  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS,DISP=SHR
//REJEITOS DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.REJEITO.SEQ,DISP=MOD
//SYSOUT   DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="acc-index amber">J3</span>
                  <span class="acc-head">
                    <span class="acc-title">JCL — EBJPOST, EBJSALD, EBJEXTR, EBJCONC e EBJEOD</span>
                    <span class="acc-sub">Fluxo diário alinhado</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span>
                </button>
                <div class="acc-panel">
                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBJPOST.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBJPOST  JOB ,'EMUNAH POST',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* APLICA OS LANCAMENTOS VALIDOS NAS CONTAS.
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=EBPOST01
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//MOVTIN   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS,DISP=SHR
//CLIENTE  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CLIENTE.KSDS,DISP=SHR
//CONTA    DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONTA.KSDS,DISP=SHR
//AUDIT    DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.AUDIT.SEQ,DISP=MOD</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBJSALD.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBJSALD  JOB ,'EMUNAH SALD',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* CONSOLIDA SALDO.
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=EBSALD01
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//SALDIN   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.SALDO.KSDS,DISP=SHR
//SALDOUT  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.SALDO.REL.SEQ,DISP=MOD</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBJEXTR.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBJEXTR  JOB ,'EMUNAH EXTR',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* GERA EXTRATO EM UMA NOVA GERACAO GDG.
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=EBEXTR01
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//MOVTIN   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS,DISP=SHR
//SALDO    DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.SALDO.KSDS,DISP=SHR
//EXTROUT  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.EXTRATO.GDG(+1),
//            DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),
//            SPACE=(TRK,(3,1)),
//            DCB=(RECFM=FB,LRECL=132,BLKSIZE=0)</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBJCONC.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBJCONC  JOB ,'EMUNAH CONC',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* CONCILIA O PROCESSAMENTO DO DIA.
//STEP1    EXEC PGM=EBCONC01
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.DEV.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//MOVTIN   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.LANCTO.ESDS,DISP=SHR
//CONCOUT  DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONCIL.SEQ,DISP=MOD</pre>
                  </div>

                  <div class="code">
                    <div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL — EBJEOD.jcl</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div>
<pre>//EBJEOD   JOB ,'EMUNAH EOD',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X,MSGLEVEL=(1,1)
//* BACKUP + FECHAMENTO DO DIA.
//BAKCONTS EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//INVSAM   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.CONTA.KSDS,DISP=SHR
//OUTBAK   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.BAK.CONTA.SEQ,DISP=MOD
//SYSIN    DD *
  REPRO INFILE(INVSAM) OUTFILE(OUTBAK)
/*
//REGFECH  EXEC PGM=IEBGENER,COND=(4,LT,BAKCONTS)
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSUT1   DD *
EOD-OK  EBJEOD  FECHAMENTO DIARIO CONCLUIDO COM SUCESSO
/*
//SYSUT2   DD DSN=Z77948.EMUNAH.ARQ.AUDIT.SEQ,DISP=MOD
//SYSIN    DD DUMMY</pre>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-note">
              <div class="small">manual ampliado</div>
              <h3>Os principais fontes já estão documentados aqui</h3>
              <p>Você pode usar esta seção como base de estudo, referência para entrevistas e guia de evolução do lab.</p>
            </div>
          <section class="section" id="consultas">
            <div class="section-header">
              <div class="eyebrow">R1 // Consultas &amp; referência</div>
              <h2 class="section-title">Guia completo de desenvolvimento mainframe</h2>
              <p class="section-desc">Referência prática para laboratório e operação z/OS, organizada para consulta rápida durante estudo, troubleshooting e execução do dia a dia.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="notice info">
              <div>📘</div>
              <p><strong>Objetivo desta área:</strong> servir como guia de referência operacional. Use o sumário clicável abaixo, a pesquisa do site e os botões de expandir/recolher para navegar mais rápido pelo conteúdo.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="guide-toolbar" data-guide-controls>
              <div class="guide-toolbar-text">
                <strong>Sumário rápido</strong>
                <span>Navegue por capítulos e controle a expansão dos tópicos desta seção.</span>
              </div>
