            <div class="accordion-list guide-accordion-list">
              <article class="accordion open" id="consultas-ambiente">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="true"><span class="acc-index">1</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Ambiente &amp; Ferramentas</span><span class="acc-sub">Zowe CLI, Git, TSO / ISPF e setup do laboratório</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <h3>1.1 Zowe CLI — Comandos mais usados</h3>
                  <p>O Zowe CLI é uma ferramenta open-source que permite interagir com o mainframe z/OS a partir do terminal do seu computador local, sem precisar de emulador 3270.</p>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">bash</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>npm install -g @zowe/cli
zowe --version

zowe profiles create zosmf meu-perfil \
  --host meu-mainframe.empresa.com \
  --port 443 \
  --user MEUSUSR \
  --password MINHASENHA \
  --reject-unauthorized false

zowe profiles set-default zosmf meu-perfil</pre></div>
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Categoria</th><th>Comando</th><th>Descrição</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><strong>Datasets</strong></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files list ds "HLQ.*"</td><td>Lista datasets por HLQ</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files list am "MY.PDS"</td><td>Lista membros de PDS</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files view ds "MY.FILE"</td><td>Exibe conteúdo de dataset</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files view am "MY.PDS(MEMBRO)"</td><td>Exibe membro</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files download ds "MY.FILE" -f local.txt</td><td>Baixa dataset</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files upload file local.cbl "MY.PDS(MBR)"</td><td>Faz upload</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files create ds "MY.NEW.DS" --ps</td><td>Cria dataset sequencial</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Jobs</strong></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-jobs submit ds "MY.JCL(MYJOB)"</td><td>Submete job</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-jobs submit lf "local.jcl"</td><td>Submete JCL local</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-jobs list js --owner MEUSUSR</td><td>Lista jobs do usuário</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-jobs view jsbj JOB12345</td><td>Detalhes do job</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-jobs view sfbi JOB12345 2</td><td>Exibe SYSOUT do step</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-jobs download ofbj JOB12345</td><td>Baixa output do job</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>USS</strong></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-files list uf "/u/meususr"</td><td>Lista arquivos USS</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Console</strong></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-console issue cmd "D A,L"</td><td>Emite comando z/OS</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>TSO</strong></td><td class="mono">zowe zos-tso issue cmd "LISTDS 'MY.DS'"</td><td>Executa comando TSO</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                  <h3>1.2 Git no Mainframe — Comandos mais usados</h3>
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Categoria</th><th>Comando</th><th>Descrição</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><strong>Configuração</strong></td><td class="mono">git config --global user.name "Seu Nome"</td><td>Define nome</td></tr>
                    <tr><td></td><td class="mono">git config --global user.email "email@empresa.com"</td><td>Define e-mail</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Repositório</strong></td><td class="mono">git init / git clone https://repo.url</td><td>Inicia ou clona</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Status &amp; Log</strong></td><td class="mono">git status / git log --oneline --graph</td><td>Estado e histórico</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Staging &amp; Commit</strong></td><td class="mono">git add . / git commit -m "mensagem"</td><td>Staging e commit</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Branches</strong></td><td class="mono">git checkout -b feature/nova</td><td>Cria e muda de branch</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Remote</strong></td><td class="mono">git pull origin main / git push origin main</td><td>Sincroniza</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Desfazer</strong></td><td class="mono">git restore arquivo.cbl / git reset --hard HEAD~1</td><td>Reverte alterações</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Stash</strong></td><td class="mono">git stash / git stash pop</td><td>Guarda mudanças</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">.gitignore</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre># Compilados
*.lst
*.obj
*.load

# Temporários
*.tmp
*.bak

# Saídas
*.sysout
*.dump</pre></div>
                  <h3>1.3 TSO / ISPF — Comandos e navegação básica</h3>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">TSO / ISPF</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>LISTDS 'MY.DATASET'              - Informações do dataset
LISTDS 'MY.PDS' MEMBERS          - Lista membros do PDS
ALLOCATE DS('MY.NEW.DS') ...     - Aloca dataset
DELETE 'MY.DATASET'              - Deleta dataset
RENAME 'OLD.DS' 'NEW.DS'         - Renomeia dataset
SUBMIT 'MY.JCL(MYJOB)'           - Submete job
STATUS                           - Status de jobs
CANCEL jobname                   - Cancela job
PROFILE                          - Exibe perfil TSO
LOGOFF                           - Sai do TSO

=3.4    - Dataset List
=3.2    - Dataset Utility
=3.1    - Compressão de PDS
=2      - Editor ISPF
=5      - Submeter JCL
=SD     - SDSF

F texto           - Localiza texto
C texto1 texto2   - Substitui texto
CC ... CC         - Copia bloco
MM ... MM         - Move bloco
COL               - Exibe régua
HEX ON            - Modo hexadecimal
SAVE / END        - Salva e sai</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-linguagens">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">2</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Linguagens &amp; Compilação</span><span class="acc-sub">COBOL, JCL e fundamentos de build</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <h3>2.1 COBOL — Estrutura e exemplos</h3>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
   PROGRAM-ID.   MEUPROG.
   AUTHOR.       DESENVOLVEDOR.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
   CONFIGURATION SECTION.
   INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
   FILE-CONTROL.
       SELECT ARQUIVO-ENTRADA ASSIGN TO ENTRADA.
       SELECT ARQUIVO-SAIDA   ASSIGN TO SAIDA.

DATA DIVISION.
   FILE SECTION.
   FD ARQUIVO-ENTRADA.
   01 REG-ENTRADA.
       05 WS-CAMPO1  PIC X(10).
       05 WS-CAMPO2  PIC 9(8).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
   01 WS-VARIAVEIS.
      05 WS-CONTADOR PIC 9(5) VALUE ZEROS.
      05 WS-NOME     PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
   INICIO.
       OPEN INPUT ARQUIVO-ENTRADA
       PERFORM PROCESSAR UNTIL WS-FIM = 'S'
       CLOSE ARQUIVO-ENTRADA
       STOP RUN.</pre></div>
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Verbo</th><th>Uso</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>MOVE</code></td><td>Atribuição de valores</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>ADD</code>, <code>SUBTRACT</code>, <code>MULTIPLY</code>, <code>DIVIDE</code></td><td>Aritmética</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>COMPUTE</code></td><td>Expressões matemáticas</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IF / ELSE / END-IF</code></td><td>Desvio condicional</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>EVALUATE</code></td><td>CASE/SWITCH</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>PERFORM</code></td><td>Laços e rotinas</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>READ / WRITE / OPEN / CLOSE</code></td><td>Operações com arquivos</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>CALL</code></td><td>Chamada de subprograma</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>EXEC SQL</code></td><td>Acesso a DB2</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>EXEC CICS</code></td><td>Acesso a CICS</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                  <h3>2.2 JCL — Estrutura e parâmetros</h3>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">JCL</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>//MYJOB    JOB (CONTA),'DESCRICAO',
//             CLASS=A,
//             MSGCLASS=X,
//             MSGLEVEL=(1,1),
//             NOTIFY=&SYSUID,
//             REGION=0M
//STEP010  EXEC PGM=IEBGENER
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSIN    DD DUMMY
//SYSUT1   DD DSN=MY.INPUT.FILE,DISP=SHR
//SYSUT2   DD DSN=MY.OUTPUT.FILE,
//             DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),
//             UNIT=SYSDA,
//             SPACE=(CYL,(1,1)),
//             DCB=(RECFM=FB,LRECL=80,BLKSIZE=0)</pre></div>
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Parâmetro</th><th>Valores comuns</th><th>Descrição</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>CLASS</code></td><td>A-Z, 0-9</td><td>Classe de execução</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>MSGCLASS</code></td><td>A-X</td><td>Classe de saída</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>MSGLEVEL</code></td><td>(1,1) / (2,0)</td><td>Nível de mensagens</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>NOTIFY</code></td><td>&amp;SYSUID</td><td>Notifica usuário</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>REGION</code></td><td>0M, 128M</td><td>Memória disponível</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>TIME</code></td><td>(mm,ss)</td><td>Limite de CPU</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">DISP</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>DISP=(status-novo, status-normal, status-abend)
NEW - Dataset novo
OLD - Dataset existente, exclusivo
SHR - Dataset existente, compartilhado
MOD - Acrescenta ao final
KEEP / CATLG / DELETE / UNCATLG</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-db2">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">3</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Banco de Dados DB2</span><span class="acc-sub">SQL, utilitários e execução batch</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">SQL DB2</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>SELECT NOME, SALDO, DT_NASCIMENTO
  FROM DB2ADM.CLIENTES
 WHERE CD_STATUS = 'A'
   AND SALDO > 1000
 ORDER BY NOME;

INSERT INTO DB2ADM.MOVIMENTOS
       (NR_CONTA, VL_MOVIMENTO, TP_MOVIMENTO, DT_MOVIMENTO)
VALUES (:WS-CONTA, :WS-VALOR, 'C', CURRENT DATE);

UPDATE DB2ADM.CLIENTES
   SET SALDO      = SALDO + :WS-VALOR,
       DT_ALTERAC = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
 WHERE NR_CONTA   = :WS-CONTA;

DELETE FROM DB2ADM.MOVIMENTOS
 WHERE DT_MOVIMENTO < (CURRENT DATE - 365 DAYS)
   AND TP_STATUS = 'P';</pre></div>
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>SQLCODE</th><th>Significado</th><th>Ação</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td class="mono">0</td><td>Sucesso</td><td>OK</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">+100</td><td>NOT FOUND</td><td>Tratar lógica</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">-104</td><td>Token inválido</td><td>Verificar sintaxe</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">-204</td><td>Objeto não encontrado</td><td>Verificar nomes</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">-803</td><td>Chave duplicada</td><td>Verificar dados</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">-805</td><td>DBRM não encontrado</td><td>Fazer bind</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">-911</td><td>Timeout / Deadlock</td><td>Verificar concorrência</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">-922</td><td>Sem autorização</td><td>Solicitar grant</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">DSNUTILB</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>//LOADDB2  EXEC PGM=DSNUTILB,PARM='DBNAME'
//SYSIN    DD *
  LOAD DATA INDDN(LOADFILE)
       INTO TABLE DB2ADM.CLIENTES
       (NR_CONTA POSITION(1:10) CHAR,
        NOME     POSITION(11:50) CHAR,
        SALDO    POSITION(51:65) DECIMAL)
  NOCOPYPEND
/*

//REORGTS  EXEC PGM=DSNUTILB,PARM='DBNAME'
//SYSIN    DD *
  REORG TABLESPACE DBNAME.TSNAME
  LOG NO
/*

//RUNSTATS EXEC PGM=DSNUTILB,PARM='DBNAME'
//SYSIN    DD *
  RUNSTATS TABLESPACE DBNAME.TSNAME TABLE(ALL) INDEX(ALL)
/*</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-utilitarios">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">4</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Programas Utilitários</span><span class="acc-sub">IEBGENER, IEBCOPY, IDCAMS, SORT e IEFBR14</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">IEBGENER / IEBCOPY / IDCAMS / SORT / IEFBR14</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>//COPY001  EXEC PGM=IEBGENER
//SYSUT1   DD DSN=ORIGEM.DATASET,DISP=SHR
//SYSUT2   DD DSN=DESTINO.DATASET,
//             DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),
//             UNIT=SYSDA,SPACE=(CYL,(1,1)),
//             DCB=(RECFM=FB,LRECL=80,BLKSIZE=0)

//COPYPDS  EXEC PGM=IEBCOPY
//SYSUT1   DD DSN=ORIGEM.PDS,DISP=SHR
//SYSUT2   DD DSN=DESTINO.PDS,DISP=SHR
//SYSIN    DD *
  COPY INDD=SYSUT1,OUTDD=SYSUT2
/*

//DEFVSAM  EXEC PGM=IDCAMS
//SYSIN    DD *
  DEFINE CLUSTER (NAME(MEU.VSAM.KSDS) INDEXED KEYS(10 0) RECORDSIZE(100 100) TRACKS(5 5) CISZ(4096))
/*

//SORT001  EXEC PGM=SORT
//SORTIN   DD DSN=ENTRADA.DATASET,DISP=SHR
//SORTOUT  DD DSN=SAIDA.DATASET,DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE)
//SYSIN    DD *
  SORT FIELDS=(1,10,CH,A,11,8,CH,D)
/*

//ALOC001  EXEC PGM=IEFBR14
//NEWFILE  DD DSN=MEU.NOVO.DATASET,
//             DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),
//             UNIT=SYSDA,
//             SPACE=(CYL,(5,2)),
//             DCB=(RECFM=FB,LRECL=80,BLKSIZE=0)</pre></div>
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Programa</th><th>Família</th><th>Função principal</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>IEBGENER</code></td><td>IEB</td><td>Cópia de datasets sequenciais</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IEBCOPY</code></td><td>IEB</td><td>Cópia e compactação de PDS</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IDCAMS</code></td><td>IDC</td><td>VSAM, catálogo, REPRO</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>SORT</code></td><td>—</td><td>Ordenação e transformação</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>ICETOOL</code></td><td>—</td><td>Utilitário avançado de SORT</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IEFBR14</code></td><td>IEF</td><td>Alocação/deleção</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>DSNUTILB</code></td><td>DSN</td><td>Utilitários DB2</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IKJEFT01</code></td><td>IKJ</td><td>TSO batch / DSN</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>DFHCSDUP</code></td><td>DFH</td><td>Manutenção CSD CICS</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IGYWCL</code></td><td>IGY</td><td>PROC compilação COBOL</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IGYCRCTL</code></td><td>IGY</td><td>Compilador COBOL isolado</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>IEWL</code></td><td>IEW</td><td>Linkeditor</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-cics">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">5</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">CICS</span><span class="acc-sub">Conceitos básicos, comandos usados e DFHCSDUP</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Conceito</th><th>Descrição</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><strong>Transaction</strong></td><td>Unidade de trabalho online</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>TRANSID</strong></td><td>Código de 4 chars</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Program</strong></td><td>Programa COBOL/Assembler associado</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>CSD</strong></td><td>CICS System Definition</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>COMMAREA</strong></td><td>Área de comunicação</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Map / Mapset</strong></td><td>Tela BMS</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">EXEC CICS / DFHCSDUP</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>EXEC CICS READ DATASET('CLIENTES') INTO(WS-REG-CLIENTE) RIDFLD(WS-NR-CONTA) RESP(WS-RESP) END-EXEC.
EXEC CICS WRITE DATASET('CLIENTES') FROM(WS-REG-CLIENTE) RIDFLD(WS-NR-CONTA) END-EXEC.
EXEC CICS SEND MAP('MAPMENU') MAPSET('MAPSET01') ERASE END-EXEC.
EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('OUTRO') COMMAREA(WS-COMMAREA) LENGTH(100) END-EXEC.

//CSDUTIL  EXEC PGM=DFHCSDUP,REGION=0M
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=CICS.LOADLIB,DISP=SHR
//DFHCSD   DD DSN=CICS.CSD,DISP=SHR
//SYSIN    DD *
  LIST ALL
/*</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-simulacoes">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">6</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Simulações de tarefas diárias</span><span class="acc-sub">Compilar, executar, criar datasets, SQL batch, deploy e remessa</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="diagram"><pre>Código COBOL (.cbl) → Compilador (IGYCRCTL) → Objeto (.obj)
Objeto (.obj) → Linkeditor (IEWL) → Load Module (.load)
Load Module → Execução (EXEC PGM=)</pre></div>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">Batch operacional</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>//COMPJOB  JOB (CONTA),'COMPILAR COBOL',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X
//COBCLG   EXEC IGYWCL
//COBOL.SYSIN DD DSN=MY.SOURCE.COBOL(MEUPROG),DISP=SHR
//LKED.SYSLMOD DD DSN=MY.LOAD.LIB(MEUPROG),DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),UNIT=SYSDA,SPACE=(CYL,(1,1,1))

//EXECJOB  JOB (CONTA),'EXECUTAR PROGRAMA',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X
//STEP010  EXEC PGM=MEUPROG,REGION=0M
//STEPLIB  DD DSN=MY.LOAD.LIB,DISP=SHR
//ENTRADA  DD DSN=MY.INPUT.FILE,DISP=SHR
//SAIDA    DD DSN=MY.OUTPUT.FILE,DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),UNIT=SYSDA,SPACE=(CYL,(5,2))

zowe zos-jobs submit ds "MY.JCL(EXECJOB)"
zowe zos-jobs list js --owner MEUSUSR
zowe zos-jobs view sfbi JOB12345 2

//CRIA001  EXEC PGM=IEFBR14
//DATASET  DD DSN=MEU.NOVO.FILE,DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE),UNIT=SYSDA,SPACE=(TRK,(10,5)),DCB=(RECFM=FB,LRECL=80,BLKSIZE=0)

//SQLBATCH JOB (CONTA),'SQL BATCH',CLASS=A,MSGCLASS=X
//STEP010  EXEC PGM=IKJEFT01,DYNAMNBR=20
//SYSTSIN  DD *
  DSN SYSTEM(DB2P)
  RUN PROGRAM(DSNTEP2) PLAN(DSNTEP2) LIB('DB2.RUNLIB.LOAD')
  END
/*

//DEPLOY   JOB (CONTA),'DEPLOY PRODUCAO',CLASS=A
//STEP010  EXEC PGM=IEBCOPY
//INLIB    DD DSN=DEV.LOAD.LIB,DISP=SHR
//OUTLIB   DD DSN=PRD.LOAD.LIB,DISP=SHR
//SYSIN    DD *
  COPY INDD=INLIB,OUTDD=OUTLIB
  SELECT MEMBER=((MEUPROG,,R))
/*</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-problemas">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">7</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Simulações de problemas &amp; resolução</span><span class="acc-sub">ABEND, RC ≠ 0, ENQ/DEQ, SQL, espaço e RACF</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">Checklist de investigação</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>1. Verificar o ABEND CODE no output do job
2. Localizar o step que abendou
3. Verificar SYSOUT do step
4. Verificar CEEDUMP ou SYSUDUMP
5. Consultar tabela de ABENDs
6. Analisar dados de entrada
7. Corrigir e re-submeter

RC comuns: 4 = warning, 8 = erro leve, 12 = erro grave, 16 = erro fatal

//STEP020  EXEC PGM=MEUPROG,COND=(8,LT,STEP010)

zowe zos-console issue cmd "D GRS,RES=(DATASET,'MY.LOCKED.DS')"

PERMIT 'MY.DATASET.*' ID(MEUSUSR) ACCESS(UPDATE)</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-abends">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">8</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">ABENDs — dicionário de erros</span><span class="acc-sub">Sxxx, Uxxx, SQLCODEs, RCs e dumps</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>ABEND</th><th>Nome</th><th>Causa</th><th>Solução</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S0C1</td><td>Operation Exception</td><td>Instrução inválida</td><td>Verificar lógica</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S0C4</td><td>Protection Exception</td><td>Acesso inválido de memória</td><td>Verificar ponteiros e tabelas</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S0C7</td><td>Data Exception</td><td>Dado não numérico em PIC 9</td><td>Verificar entrada</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S013</td><td>Open Error</td><td>DCB incompatível ou sem autorização</td><td>Verificar DCB/RACF</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S222</td><td>Job Cancelled</td><td>Cancelado por operador</td><td>Verificar motivo</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S322</td><td>Time Limit</td><td>Tempo excedido</td><td>Otimizar / loop</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S806</td><td>Load Module Not Found</td><td>Programa não encontrado</td><td>Verificar STEPLIB</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">S913</td><td>RACF Abend</td><td>Sem autorização</td><td>Solicitar acesso</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="mono">B37/D37/E37</td><td>Out of Space</td><td>Sem espaço</td><td>Aumentar SPACE</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">Como ler um dump</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>1. HEADER — Informações do job
2. ABEND CODE — Código do abend
3. PSW — Endereço da instrução com problema
4. GPR — Registradores
5. STORAGE DUMP — Memória em hex/EBCDIC
6. TRACEBACK — Pilha de chamadas

Dica para S0C7:
- localizar PSW
- correlacionar com mapa de linkagem
- identificar o parágrafo COBOL
- inspecionar o campo em storage
- X'40' (espaço) em campo PIC 9 costuma ser a causa</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-cheats">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">9</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Referência rápida — cheat sheets</span><span class="acc-sub">Zowe, Git, JCL, COBOL, SQL DB2 e utilitários</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">Cheat sheets</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>zowe zos-files list ds "HLQ.*"
zowe zos-files view ds "MY.FILE"
zowe zos-files upload file local.txt "MY.DS"
zowe zos-jobs submit ds "MY.JCL(JOB)"
zowe zos-jobs list js --owner MEUSUSR

git status
git add .
git commit -m "mensagem"
git push
git checkout -b feature/X

git restore arquivo
git reset --hard HEAD~1

DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE)
SPACE=(CYL,(5,2))
DCB=(RECFM=FB,LRECL=80)
COND=(8,LT,STEP010)

MOVE valor TO campo
COMPUTE resultado = val1 + val2 * val3
EVALUATE campo
READ arquivo AT END MOVE 'S' TO fim END-READ
CALL 'PROGRAMA' USING var1 var2

SELECT col1, col2 FROM tabela WHERE cond;
INSERT INTO tabela (col1, col2) VALUES (:var1, :var2);
UPDATE tabela SET col1 = :var1 WHERE chave = :chave;</pre></div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-glossario">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">10</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">Glossário</span><span class="acc-sub">Termos e siglas do mundo mainframe</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
