              <article class="accordion" id="consultas-cobol-bancos">
                <button type="button" class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false"><span class="acc-index">11</span><span class="acc-head"><span class="acc-title">COBOL — comandos mais usados em bancos</span><span class="acc-sub">Movimentação de dados, cálculos, fluxo, arquivos, DB2 e exemplo completo</span></span><span class="acc-chevron">⌄</span></button>
                <div class="acc-panel guide-panel">
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">MOVE / COMPUTE / EVALUATE / DB2</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>MOVE WS-SALDO-ATUAL TO WS-SALDO-ANTERIOR
MOVE ZEROS TO WS-CONTADOR
MOVE CORRESPONDING WS-CLIENTE-ENTRADA TO WS-CLIENTE-SAIDA
STRING WS-DDD DELIMITED BY SPACE '-' DELIMITED BY SIZE WS-FONE DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-FONE-FORMATADO
UNSTRING WS-LINHA-RETORNO DELIMITED BY ';' INTO WS-CAMPO1 WS-CAMPO2 WS-CAMPO3
INSPECT WS-CAMPO TALLYING WS-CONTADOR FOR ALL SPACES

ADD WS-VALOR-CREDITO TO WS-SALDO-CONTA
SUBTRACT WS-VALOR-DEBITO FROM WS-SALDO-CONTA
MULTIPLY WS-TAXA-JUROS BY WS-SALDO GIVING WS-VALOR-JUROS
DIVIDE WS-TOTAL-DIVIDA BY WS-QTD-PARCELAS GIVING WS-VALOR-PARCELA
COMPUTE WS-IOF = WS-VALOR-OPERACAO * WS-ALIQ-IOF * WS-DIAS-CORRIDOS

IF WS-SALDO >= WS-VALOR-SAQUE
    PERFORM ROT-APROVAR-SAQUE
ELSE
    PERFORM ROT-RECUSAR-SAQUE
END-IF

EVALUATE WS-TIPO-MOVIMENTO
    WHEN 'PIX' PERFORM ROT-PROCESSA-PIX
    WHEN 'TED' PERFORM ROT-PROCESSA-TED
    WHEN OTHER PERFORM ROT-TIPO-INVALIDO
END-EVALUATE

OPEN INPUT  ARQ-MOVIMENTOS
READ ARQ-MOVIMENTOS AT END MOVE 'S' TO WS-FIM-ARQUIVO END-READ
WRITE REG-SAIDA FROM WS-REGISTRO-SAIDA
REWRITE REG-CLIENTES FROM WS-CLIENTE-ATUALIZADO
DELETE ARQ-CLIENTES-VSAM

EXEC SQL SELECT NR_CONTA, NOME_CLIENTE, VL_SALDO INTO :WS-NR-CONTA, :WS-NOME-CLIENTE, :WS-VL-SALDO FROM DB2ADM.TB_CLIENTES WHERE NR_CONTA = :WS-CONTA-PESQ END-EXEC
EXEC SQL INSERT INTO DB2ADM.TB_MOVIMENTOS (...) VALUES (...) END-EXEC
EXEC SQL UPDATE DB2ADM.TB_CLIENTES SET VL_SALDO = VL_SALDO + :MV-VL_MOVIMENTO END-EXEC
EXEC SQL COMMIT END-EXEC
EXEC SQL ROLLBACK END-EXEC

CALL 'PGMVALID' USING WS-DADOS-ENTRADA WS-CODIGO-RETORNO
INITIALIZE WS-REGISTRO-SAIDA
MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-DATA-HORA-COMPLETA</pre></div>
                  <div class="code"><div class="code-head"><span class="code-lang">COBOL — exemplo bancário típico</span><button type="button" class="copy" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre>IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. PGMSLDBAT.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
 FILE-CONTROL.
     SELECT ARQ-MOVIMENTOS ASSIGN TO MOVTOS
         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
         ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
         FILE STATUS  IS WS-STATUS-MOVTOS.

DATA DIVISION.
 FILE SECTION.
 FD ARQ-MOVIMENTOS.
 01 REG-MOVIMENTO.
    05 MV-NR-CONTA     PIC 9(10).
    05 MV-TP-MOVIMENTO PIC X(02).
    05 MV-VL-MOVIMENTO PIC 9(13)V99.
    05 MV-DT-MOVIMENTO PIC 9(08).

 EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 0000-PRINCIPAL.
     PERFORM 1000-INICIAR
     PERFORM 2000-PROCESSAR UNTIL FIM-ARQUIVO
     PERFORM 3000-FINALIZAR
     STOP RUN.

 2000-PROCESSAR.
     EVALUATE MV-TP-MOVIMENTO
         WHEN 'CR' PERFORM 2100-PROCESSAR-CREDITO
         WHEN 'DB' PERFORM 2200-PROCESSAR-DEBITO
         WHEN OTHER ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-ERROS
     END-EVALUATE.

 2100-PROCESSAR-CREDITO.
     EXEC SQL
         UPDATE DB2ADM.TB_CLIENTES
            SET VL_SALDO = VL_SALDO + :MV-VL-MOVIMENTO,
                DT_ULT_MOVTO = CURRENT DATE
          WHERE NR_CONTA = :MV-NR-CONTA
     END-EXEC.</pre></div>
                  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Categoria</th><th>Comando</th><th>Uso principal em bancos</th></tr></thead><tbody>
                    <tr><td><strong>Dados</strong></td><td><code>MOVE</code>, <code>MOVE CORRESPONDING</code>, <code>INITIALIZE</code>, <code>STRING</code>, <code>UNSTRING</code>, <code>INSPECT</code></td><td>Atribuição, limpeza e montagem de registros</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Aritmética</strong></td><td><code>ADD</code>, <code>SUBTRACT</code>, <code>MULTIPLY</code>, <code>DIVIDE</code>, <code>COMPUTE</code></td><td>Saldo, juros, IOF, parcelas</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Fluxo</strong></td><td><code>IF</code>, <code>EVALUATE</code>, <code>PERFORM</code>, <code>SET</code></td><td>Validações e laços</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Arquivo</strong></td><td><code>OPEN</code>, <code>READ</code>, <code>WRITE</code>, <code>REWRITE</code>, <code>DELETE</code></td><td>Entrada, saída e VSAM</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>DB2</strong></td><td><code>EXEC SQL SELECT / INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE / COMMIT / ROLLBACK</code></td><td>Persistência transacional</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Subprog</strong></td><td><code>CALL</code>, <code>GOBACK</code></td><td>Rotinas compartilhadas</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>Encerramento</strong></td><td><code>STOP RUN</code></td><td>Fim do programa principal</td></tr>
                  </tbody></table></div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          </section>
        </div>
      </section>

